<title>FINLAND: FINLAND BANK OCT DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 6.76 BLN.</title>
<headline>FINLAND BANK OCT DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 6.76 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland said on</p>
<p>Tuesday the required daily money market liquidity balance for</p>
<p>the rest of the month was 6.76 billion markka.</p>
<p>The central bank gave the following figures (FIM mln):</p>
<p> Liquidity estimate for Oct 10			8,500</p>
<p> Minimum reserve requirement for Oct		6,469</p>
<p> Average reserves to Oct 7			    5,457</p>
<p> Required daily balance for remaining period    6,764</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom, +358-0-680 50 245</p>
</text>
